==Utility spells==
Utility spells are spells that are typically used outside of combat, such as enchanting items.

===Alchemy spells===
Alchemy spells convert items into other items. Including the following: [[Low Level Alchemy]] and [[High Level Alchemy]] convert items into certain amounts of coins, and [[Superheat Item]] may be used to forge [[ore]] into [[bar]]s without a [[furnace]]. These three spells all use nature runes and fire runes. Standard magic also includes; [[Bones to Bananas]], and [[Bones to Peaches]], which use Nature, Earth, and, Water runes.

