==Trivia==
*Within the game cache, there are three unused spell icons that can be found ([[File:Unused standard spell 1.png]] [[File:Unused standard spell 2.png]] [[File:Unused standard spell 3.png]]). These were scrapped summoning spells from ''[[RuneScape Classic]]'' that utilised [[classicrsw:Life-Rune|life runes]], which were also scrapped.
[[File:Restraint icon (mobile).png|right]]
*There is also one unused mobile spell icon within the game cache, which is the icon for Restraint, a level 89 spell costing 5 Wrath, 10 Fire and 10 Earth runes per cast, capable of hitting up to 8 damage and being able to freeze a single opponent for 20 seconds. This spell was offered in the [[Poll:Revenant Cave Rewards: Revisited & Content Changes Poll|Revenant Cave Rewards: Revisited & Content Changes Poll]], but failed by 3.3% votes.

